  "content": "\n\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131409/description_12976af1-f1b3-4c22-a237-76078d49215d.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>一個以 Create 自動化、冒險與完整整合的經濟系統為核心的海洋生存體驗。</strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>特色：</strong></h1>\n<h2>📦 | <strong><em>所有</em></strong><em>最</em><strong><em>受</em></strong><em>歡迎的</em><strong><em>Create</em></strong><strong><em> </em><em style=\"display:inline !important\">附加模組</em></strong></h2>\n<h2>📋 |&nbsp;<em><strong>數百種</strong></em>自訂<strong>配方新增<br></strong></h2>\n<h2>🧭 |&nbsp;<strong>大量</strong>自訂<strong>物品</strong>與<strong>貼圖</strong></h2>\n<h2>🪙 | 一個<em><strong>完全</strong>整合的<strong>&nbsp;</strong></em><em><strong>經濟系統</strong></em></h2>\n<h2>🏭 | <em><strong>龐大</strong></em>自訂<strong><em>進度系統<br></em></strong></h2>\n<h2>📖 |&nbsp;<em><strong>數百個</strong></em>獨特的&nbsp;<em><strong>FTB</strong></em> <strong><em>任務</em></strong></h2>\n<h2>🛩️ | 眾多以探索為主的模組&nbsp;<strong><br></strong></h2>\n<h2>🏝️ | <em><strong>完美</strong></em>適合單人及多人遊戲&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>🔆 | <em>全面優化</em></strong>支援<strong><em>光影</em></strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<h3><span><span><iframe style=\"width:883px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n15S2EQTNyg?si=TuHjFQo85NTLdMn6\" width=\"790\" height=\"535\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><a href=\"https://patreon.com/OurCreation?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131409/description_a3faa75a-7da6-4107-84e9-7d4fc7c0e863.png\"></a></h3>",
